license: MIT
repository-code: "https://github.com/ShuyaoGao/snake-dqn-brain"
url: "https://ShuyaoGao.github.io/snake-dqn-brain/play/"
abstract: >-
  A browser-only teaching demo (AI Teaching Demos): a convolutional Double DQN agent plays
  Snake on a 10x10 grid while a live "brain panel" shows the real activations, contributions and
  Q values computed from the trained weights. Includes a you-vs-DQN mode, knock-out of neurons,
  and the full PyTorch training code.
keywords:
  - course-demo
  - reinforcement-learning
  - deep-q-network
  - convolutional-neural-network
